<h2 id="3-the-admin-dashboard">3. The Admin Dashboard</h2>
<p>The Dashboard is your home base as a site administrator. Think of it as a control panel — everything you need to manage the website is just one or two clicks away from here.</p>
<h3 id="getting-to-the-dashboard">Getting to the Dashboard</h3>
<p>Once you are signed in, click <strong>Dashboard</strong> in the navigation bar at the top of any page. You will be taken directly to your Dashboard.</p>
<h3 id="dashboard-create-new">Create New</h3>
<p>The top section of the Dashboard has four large buttons for creating new content:</p>
<table>
