</tr>
<tr>
<td><strong>New Photo Gallery</strong></td>
<td>Opens the form to create a new photo album. See <strong>Section 5: Managing Photo Galleries</strong> for full instructions.</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><strong>New Member</strong></td>
<td>Opens the form to add someone to the private church member directory. See <strong>Section 6: Managing Church Members</strong> for full instructions.</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><strong>Upload Photos</strong></td>
<td>Takes you directly to the photo upload form so you can add new images to the library. See <strong>Section 7: The Image Library</strong> for full instructions.</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<h3 id="dashboard-browse">Browse</h3>
